Design Justification

1. Did you use a specific framework? If yes, which one and why is it appropriate for this use case?
[I used the CARE framework, I used this framework because it gives examples with the RIO calculations. This framework seemed to be the right fit for what the prompt needed to achieve.]

2. Why did you structure your prompt this way? What specific elements did you include?
[I included a target audience because it would better understand what this product is marketed to. I made my prompt a few sentences because I have discovered that the shorter and straight to the point the prompt is the better the output.]

3. How does your prompt guide the AI effectively?
[My prompt is clear and reusable because it can easily be changed for what you are looking for. The guidance this prompt provides is that it clearly provides direct instructions that the AI needs to follow.]

4. What constraints or requirements did you add and why?
[The length for this prompt is a bit more complex because you need to give more specific instructions. The tone is neutral because you don’t need to fight with the AI over the results.]
